      "message": "test(motion): pin that a tilted hole is not drilled along Z\n\nHoles tilted 2 and 5 degrees in a 10 mm plate drop out of Z and\ncross recognition: the Z circle fit over all wall vertices refuses\nthe sliding section. A thin wall that the fit accepts moves no wall\nby more than FIT_TOL.\n\nRefs #3554\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
